      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really sorry to hear you're feeling this way, but I'm here for you. Remember, your worth is not determined by external circumstances. Even though the universe is vast and mysterious, our actions and emotions can have a profound impact on those around us. You're never alone in this journey you’re on. We're all connected in some way, making our existence and efforts meaningful. Push through the tough times, take comfort in the beauty of the world, and know that you are never truly alone. How about we talk about something that makes you feel uplifted or bring up a topic that might help shift your perspective?",
